## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of cross-stage ordering, backpressure propagation, and dynamic scaling in a realistic streaming pipeline. It also probes how candidates handle late data and fairness across clients.

## Key Concepts

- Per-client FIFO across stages
- Bounded queues and backpressure propagation
- Dynamic worker scaling with safe handoffs
- Late/out-of-order handling and deadlock avoidance

## Code Example

