class Event {
  constructor(clientId, seq, key, payload) {
    this.clientId = clientId;
    this.seq = seq;
    this.key = key;
    this.payload = payload;
  }
}
class ClientBuffer {
  constructor() {
    this.nextSeq = 1;
    this.queue = [];
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you audit for head-of-line blocking and ensure fairness under bursts?
- How would you extend this to multi-region deployment with clock skew considerations?

